OL,3,GNEWSAPowers to curb vape and mobile
OL,4,Ashops considered
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouthend-on-Sea City Council's cabinet
OL,7,Fwill consider what powers it has to
OL,8,Fcurb the "excessive" number of vape,
OL,9,Fmobile repair and barber shops it has
OL,10,Fon its High Street.
OL,12,FReform UK tabled a motion at full
OL,13,Fcouncil, which was deferred to the
OL,14,FLabour-led cabinet that runs the
OL,15,Fcouncil, to decide what to do.
OL,17,FLabour's Matt Dent was supportive of
OL,18,Fthe motion which called on the council
OL,19,Fto restrict these businesses opening in
OL,20,Fcouncil-owned commercial property.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
